---
import { CONFIG } from '../data/site';
const { agents, skills, commands } = CONFIG.counts;
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pill rise" style="animation-delay:.05s"><b>New</b> {agents} agents · {skills} skills · {commands} commands for Claude Code</div>
    <h1 class="rise" style="animation-delay:.15s">The <em>CMO</em> your startup <span class="strike">can finally afford.<svg viewBox="0 0 400 30" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20 C 90 6, 200 26, 396 10"/></svg></span></h1>
    <p class="lede rise" style="animation-delay:.3s">CMOkit puts a full marketing department inside Claude Code. <strong>SEO, AI search, content, ads, email and launches</strong>, run by {agents} specialists who learn your brand once and get to work. No $250k salary. No agency retainer.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas rise" style="animation-delay:.42s">
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-dark">Get CMOkit <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <a href="#team" class="btn btn-ghost">Meet the team</a>
    </div>
    {CONFIG.launchNote && (
      <p class="launch-hero rise" style="animation-delay:.48s"><span class="dot"></span><b>{CONFIG.price}</b>{CONFIG.comparePrice && <s>{CONFIG.comparePrice}</s>} {CONFIG.launchNote.charAt(0).toLowerCase() + CONFIG.launchNote.slice(1)}</p>
    )}
    <p class="fine rise" style="animation-delay:.52s">One-time payment<span>·</span>Lifetime updates<span>·</span>Installs in 2 minutes</p>

    <div class="board rise" style="animation-delay:.6s" aria-label="Example: CMOkit working on a launch">
      <div class="board-top">
        <span>your-startup / .claude</span>
        <span class="live"><span class="dot"></span>CMO ON SHIFT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-body">
        <div class="board-l">
          <h3>Monday growth briefing.<br /><em>Before your coffee.</em></h3>
          <div class="wave" id="heroWave" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="wave-meta"><span>ORGANIC SESSIONS · 12 WEEKS</span><span>illustrative</span></div>
          <div class="kpis">
            <div class="kpi"><small>Pages audited</small><b data-count="214">214</b></div>
            <div class="kpi"><small>Fixes shipped</small><b data-count="37">37</b></div>
            <div class="kpi"><small>AI citations</small><b data-count="9">9</b><b><u>new</u></b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="board-r">
          <div class="prompt"><div class="who">YOU</div><span id="typed">/launch-plan we launch on Product Hunt next Tuesday</span><span class="caret"></span></div>
          <ul class="feed" id="feed">
            <li><span class="ag">growth-strategist</span><span class="tx">Your bottleneck is signups, not traffic. Splitting this into 4 jobs.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ag">seo-technical</span><span class="tx">Fixed 12 broken canonicals. Sitemap resubmitted. <span class="ok">✓</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="ag">geo-ai-visibility</span><span class="tx">Wrote your llms.txt. Perplexity can now cite your pricing page.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ag">content-marketer</span><span class="tx">3 launch posts drafted in your voice, humanized.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ag">brand-voice</span><span class="tx">Cut two claims we can't prove. Ready to ship. <span class="ok">✓</span></span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats rise" style="animation-delay:.75s">
      <div><b>{agents}</b> specialist agents</div>
      <div><b>{skills}</b> skills</div>
      <div><b>{commands}</b> slash commands</div>
      <div><b>~2 min</b> to install</div>
      <div><b>$0</b> monthly</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
